WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.650
[No sounds]

00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:19.900
Houses and rooms are full
of perfumes, the shelves are

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:23.040
crowded with perfumes,

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:28.630
I breathe the fragrance myself
and know it and like it,

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:36.170
The distillation would intoxicate
me also, but I shall not let it.

00:00:36.170 --> 00:00:41.870
The atmosphere is not a
perfume, it has no taste of the

00:00:41.870 --> 00:00:44.090
distillation, it is odorless,

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:56.810
It is for my mouth forever,
I am in love with it,

00:00:56.810 --> 00:01:00.650
I will go to the bank by the
wood and become undisguised

00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:02.740
and naked,

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:07.420
I am mad for it to be
in contact with me.

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:10.820
The smoke of my own breath,

00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:17.560
Echoes, ripples, buzz'd whispers,
love-root, silk-thread, crotch and

00:01:17.560 --> 00:01:19.020
vine,

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:24.440
My respiration and inspiration,
the beating of my heart, the

00:01:24.440 --> 00:01:27.170
passing of blood and
air through my lungs..

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:34.400
Stop this day and night with
me and you shall possess the

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:37.720
origin of all poems,

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:41.580
You shall possess the good of
the earth and sun, (there are

00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:44.790
millions of suns left,)

00:01:44.790 --> 00:01:50.960
You shall no longer take things
at second or third hand, nor

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:54.020
look through the eyes of the dead,

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:58.160
nor feed on the spectres in books,

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:02.760
You shall not look through my
eyes either, nor take things

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:03.590
from me,

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:11.510
You shall listen to all sides
and filter them from your self.

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:17.302
[Techno Music]

